me":"Redhorn Stonethresher","text":"stat stick with a Normal/Charged Attack bonus that applies to the charged-slash combo."},{"name":"Verdict","text":"Provides CRIT Rate and ATK. Its Skill damage bonus requires collecting Crystallize shards, so it is less consistent in teams without Geo support."},{"name":"Serpent Spine","text":"Provides CRIT Rate and up to 30% damage bonus at R1 when fully stacked. Taking damage removes stacks."},{"name":"Mailed Flower","text":"main stat with ATK gained from Skill and Normal Attacks."},{"name":"Blackcliff Slasher","text":"CRIT DMG with an ATK bonus after defeating enemies; unreliable against single bosses."},{"name":"Earth Shaker","text":"Craftable ATK claymore that boosts Skill damage after a Pyro-related reaction."}],"a":[{"names":["Obsidian Codex"],"text":"Obsidian Codex provides 15% increased damage and up to 40% CRIT Rate, maximizing Mavuika's on-field damage and making CRIT building easier.","stats":"ATK%/EM · Pyro DMG Bonus · CR/CD"},{"names":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"text":"Marechaussee Hunter pairs with Furina's HP fluctuations to provide Mavuika up to 36% CRIT Rate, easing stat requirements while maximizing her damage potential.","stats":""},{"names":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"text":"Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City boosts Mavuika's off-field damage while providing teamwide Elemental DMG bonuses to amplify her teammates.","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"Melt Down","members":["Mavuika","Xilonen","Nicole","Citlali"],"text":"Mavuika drives Pyro damage, Xilonen shreds RES, Citlali provides shielding and Melt support, and Nicole boosts team damage and reaction potential.","roles":["Main DPS","Support","Buffs","Res Shred"]},{"name":"Steam Powered","members":["Mavuika","Xilonen","Nicole","Furina"],"text":"Mavuika drives Pyro damage, Furina enables Vaporize and boosts damage, Xilonen shreds RES, and Nicole provides buffs and reaction support.","roles":["Main DPS","Support","Buffs","Buffs"]},{"name":"Beach, Please!","member